paragraph.math:
$$I = \left\{ \begin{matrix}
      0 & \text{if the event does not happen} \\
      1 & \text{if the event happens}
      \end{matrix} \right.$$

$$\begin{matrix}
      S_{k} & {= S + SQ + SQ^{2} + \cdots + SQ^{k - 1}} \\
       & {= S\left( I + Q + Q^{2} + \cdots + Q^{k - 1} \right)}
      \end{matrix}$$

$$\begin{array}{lll}
      {A = \lim\limits_{k\rightarrow\infty}S_{k}} & = & {\lim\limits_{k\rightarrow\infty}S{\text{(}I + Q + Q^{2} + \cdots + Q^{k - 1}\text{)}}} \\
       & = & {S{\text{(}I + Q + Q^{2} + \cdots\text{)}} = SM}
      \end{array}$$
